  "notes": [
    "Briarwake adds the Widow: a large armored black spider with eight red eyes, bristled legs, wall and ground crawling, a charging bite and a rearing grab. Single-hunter runs vary the species; choosing two or more hunters includes both species.",
    "New Suno chainsaw recordings replace the Thornkeeper engine loops. The Widow has positional skittering, a separate chase shriek and attack cues. Garden boot footsteps and the current nighttime ambience remain.",
    "Weathered lantern, mourning bell and bound-heartwood wards replace the old objective props. Curved rooted branches, hanging growth, stones, dead grass and fallen boughs add detail without blocking objective and hiding approaches.",
    "Hunters favor separate patrol territories and alternative routes, use passing lanes and yield through shared passages. Spiders use opposing walls or descend to avoid one another.",
    "Everyone in a party must update to 0.23.22: wall orientation is now synchronized over multiplayer. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Existing settings are preserved."
  ],
